    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      270.89,
      401.9,
      295.67
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      311.09,
      401.91,
      349.19
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Telecommunication Levy(Amendment) Act, No. of 2014, and shall be deemed for all purposesto have come into operation with effect from January 1, 2014.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      364.73,
      401.88,
      456.47
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 2 of the Telecommunication Levy Act, No. 21of 2011 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d)as last amended by Act, No. 8 of 2013 is hereby furtheramended by the substitution for all the words and figuresfrom \u201ca levy called Telecommunication Levy-\u201d to the words\u201csuch telecommunication service in respect of each month.\u201dof the words and figures,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      171.81,
      471.89,
      346.32,
      483.23
    ],
    "text": "\u201ca levy called Telecommunication Levy\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      498.65,
      401.87,
      536.87
    ],
    "text": "(a)for the period commencing on or after January 1,2011 but prior to January 1, 2013, at the rate oftwenty per centum ;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      552.29,
      401.87,
      577.07
    ],
    "text": "(b)for the period commencing on or after January 1,2013 but prior to January 1, 2014\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      213.33,
      592.49,
      401.86,
      617.27
    ],
    "text": "(i) at the rate of ten per centum, on the value ofsupply of internet services ; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
