      203.09,
      401.89,
      263.63
    ],
    "text": "4.Section 4 of the principal enactment is herebyamended by the substitution for the words \u201ccredited withinseven days from the receipt of the levy to the ConsolidatedFund.\u201d of the words \u201ccredited within five days from thereceipt of the levy to the Consolidated Fund.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
